Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 28
Set Width 1000
Set Height 880
Set Padding 36
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type `clear && ruby -Ilib -e 'require "ruby-wordle"; exit RubyWordle::CLI.new(random: Random.new(41)).run(["play"])'`
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Show
Type "crane"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "niche"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "fence"
Enter
Sleep 400ms
Type "ounce"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Screenshot img/play.png
Sleep 500ms
